Package: rsdv
Type: Package
Title: Synthetic Tabular Data Generation for R
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person(given = "Kailas",
           family = "Venkitasubramanian",
           email = "kailasv@gmail.com",
           role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Generates synthetic tabular data from real datasets using
    Gaussian copula models. Provides column-type metadata, constraint
    specification, and quality/privacy evaluation metrics. Inspired by
    the Python SDV (Synthetic Data Vault) library by DataCebo.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
